-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §121: parts ט–יב apply to non-academic second
-- deputies.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `121`

@ref akn:art_121
GIVEN `a non-academic second deputy` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `parts ט–יב apply` `a non-academic second deputy` IF
    `a non-academic second deputy`
